    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730-a1">

                <pb facs="0899" n="797" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg797"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-03-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 30,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In accordance with instructions from my
                    Government I am directed to bring to the attention of the Venezuelan Government
                    the five pending cases in which American citizens claim redress, and to ask for
                    the serious and immediate consideration of these cases as presented in the
                    inclosed copy of instructions to me.</p>
                <p>My Government has devoted a considerable length of time to a very serious and
                    careful reexamination of all these cases, and in the new and fuller light in
                    which they are now again presented your excellency can not fail to take that
                    favorable action in each case that is expected by my Government.</p>
                <p>I take, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
